 "title": "Auditor-Treasurer | Beltrami County",
 "text": "Auditor-Treasurer | Beltrami County\nThis website uses cookies to enhance usability and provide you with a more personal experience. By using this website, you agree to our use of cookies as explained in our Privacy Policy.\nAgree\nSkip to main content\nSkip to footer\nBeltrami County\nMenu\nLiving Here\nExpand sub pages Living Here\nAddressing\nApplications, Licenses Permits Forms\nElections & Voting\nRecycling and Waste\nMaps\nNewsletter\nParks & Recreation\nReal Estate & Property Tax Services\nPublic Drainage Ditches\nReport a Problem\nRoads & Bridges\nVisit Bemidji\nServices\nExpand sub pages Services\nBirth, Death, & Marriage Records\nCareers\nDMV\nEmployment Services\nMaps\nPassport Services\nPublic Assistance\nPublic Health\nPublic Safety & Law Enforcement\nSocial Services\nVeterans Services\nBusiness & Development\nExpand sub pages Business & Development\nApplications, Licenses, Permits & Forms\nEnvironmental Services\nLand Records / Recorded Documents\nOrdinances\nProperty Management Portal for Businesses\nTax Forfeited Land Sales\nTimber Sales\nOur Government\nExpand sub pages Our Government\nAgendas and Minutes\nBoard of Commissioners\nBuildings and Locations\nCommunity Health Board\nContact Us\nCounty Attorney\nElected Officials\nFinancial Documents\nNews and Notices\nNewsletters\nNotary Commission\nUMN Extension\nDepartments\nExpand sub pages Departments\nAdministration\nAssessor\nAttorney\nAuditor-Treasurer\nEnvironmental Services\nFacilities Management\nGIS\nHealth & Human Services\nHuman Resources\nIT Department\nNatural Resource Management\nPublic Works Department - Highway Division\nPublic Works Department - Recycling & Waste Division\nRecorder\nSheriff's Office\nVeterans Services\n| ×\n|\n| Search |\n|\nExpand Search\nBeltrami County\nAuditor-Treasurer's Office\nSection Menu\nThe office of Auditor-Treasurer is managed under the direction of JoDee Treat. It is an elected office with a four-year election term that coincides with the terms of the County Attorney and County Sheriff.\nThe Beltrami County Auditor-Treasurer is charged with overseeing the accounting functions and creation of financial statements, calculation and collection of property taxes for all jurisdictions in the county, administering elections , coordinating vital statistics and licensing duties, and managing the county's investments.\nThe Beltrami County Auditor-Treasurer’s office is split by function as well as location:\nReal Estate and Property Tax Services on the first floor of the Administration Building\nProperty Tax billing and collecting\nPassports\nAssessor and Recorder Services\nLicense Center on the first floor of the Administration Building\nMotor Vehicle, Recreational Vehicles Licensing\nBirth, Death, and Marriage Certificates\nBusiness Licenses\nFinancial Services & Payroll on the second floor of the Administration Building\nAccounts Payable, Accounts Receivable, and Payroll\nElection Administration\nFinancial Statements\nDepartments\nAuditor-Treasurer\nToggle Menu Html.Raw(currentTopLevel.Value (\"subNavigationLinkText\")).ToString() : currentTopLevel.Name)\nAuditor-Treasurer\nView Full Menu\nToggle Menu Auditor-Treasurer\nAdministration\nToggle Section\nLocal Sales & Use Tax\nAssessor\nToggle Section\nDisabled Veterans Exclusion\nAttorney\nEnvironmental Services\nFacilities Management\nGIS\nToggle Section\nAbout Beltrami County GIS\nProperty Mapping\nHealth & Human Services\nHuman Resources\nToggle Section\nEmployee Access\nToggle Section\nEmployee Access Highway\nIT Department\nNatural Resource Management\nToggle Section\nForest Management\nPermits\nToggle Section\nSalvage Permits\nBalsam Bough Permits\nMaple Syrup Permits\nPublic Works Department - Highway Division\nPublic Works Department - Recycling & Waste Division\nRecorder\nSheriff's Office\nVeterans Services\nContact Us\nAuditor-Treasurer Department\n701 Minnesota Ave NW\nBemidji, MN 56601\nPhone: 218-333-8448\nEmail\nHours: 8:00 am - 4:30 pm\nMon-Fri\nHome\